#: c12698491ba24e8895253f8e4c5d0614 d417519897d6439283a29f7183cba230
msgid ""
"JHEMCU H743 supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver). HD goggle OSD is"
" pre-configured on UART6 on the HD goggle connector. Change OSD_TYPE to "
"\"5\" to use HD systems. This also enables the internal analog OSD system "
"which can be used simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"JHEMCU H743 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。高清护目镜 OSD 预配置在 HD 护目镜接口的 UART6 "
"上。将 OSD_TYPE 改为「5」即可使用高清系统，同时也会启用内置模拟 OSD 系统，两者可同时使用。"

